# An @infix table no rule names (`@infix`) is dead.
# error: infix_unused.grammar:13:8:
# error: @infix is unused: no rule names `@infix`
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
@infix atom
    "+" left

prog! = atom                                → (p 1)
atom  = IDENT
